# L §5.15: an ask that reaches pdf states orient (LOAD-ORIENT).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input u4: dist
def p: num = pdf(u4, 1) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  u4 = uniform(0, 4) to 0.001

ask a: p law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-ORIENT ...
